# Rust coverage (`cargo tarpaulin --engine llvm`, i.e. `-C instrument-coverage`).
# An instrumented process whose environment was cleared has no LLVM_PROFILE_FILE
# to write to, so its profile runtime falls back to `default_*.profraw` in the
# working directory. The chief-of-staff approval adapters spawn exactly such
# children, so measuring their coverage leaves these behind in the crate dir.
*.profraw

